{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "A resume goes on in a sub app of the resuming actor, and a sub app takes in its maker's bindings at birth: a binding\nthis app made after the save — so the snapshot holds none — fires in the resumed run. Plan saves the run; this goal\nthen binds Log before each goal and resumes. The resumed run goes on through this goal too, from the step after\n`call Plan`: the marker sends it to Resumed, and Log, taken in from this app, runs before Resumed starts and notes it.",
